{"step_index":224,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-04T05:23:38Z","input_tokens":80002,"cache_read_tokens":0,"output_tokens":531,"thinking":"Initial check of the diagnostic tools within the specified directory for USB hardware mode execution. Examining if the tools can verify the USB connection and execute the program as intended, given the hardware setup. Awaiting results of the diagnostic to determine next steps.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"$motor = \"C:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\xview\\programa perfecto\\1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR\"\nWrite-Host \"=== 1. ESCANEO PNP USB (TODOS LOS DISPOSITIVOS USB CONECTADOS A LA PC) ===\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\nGet-CimInstance Win32_PnPEntity | Where-Object {\n    $_.DeviceID -match \"VID_18D1|VID_19D2|VID_1B8E|Android|ADB|Fastboot|WorldCup|ZTE|B866\"\n} | Select-Object Name, Status, DeviceID | Format-Table -AutoSize\n\nWrite-Host \"=== 2. ADB DEVICES ===\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n& \"$motor\\adb.exe\" devices -l\n\nWrite-Host \"=== 3. FASTBOOT MODERNO DEVICES ===\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n& \"$motor\\fastboot_moderno.exe\" devices -l\n\nWrite-Host \"=== 4. ADNL DEVICES ===\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n& \"$motor\\adnl.exe\" devices\n\nWrite-Host \"=== 5. UPDATE.EXE IDENTIFY ===\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n& \"$motor\\update.exe\" identify 7\n\nWrite-Host \"=== 6. UNIDADES USB EN LA PC ===\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\nGet-Volume | Where-Object { $_.DriveLetter } | Select-Object DriveLetter, FileSystemLabel, FileSystem, DriveType, SizeRemaining\n","WaitMsBeforeAsync":8000,"toolSummary":"Run hardware radar and tool verification on connected box"}}]}
{"step_index":225,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-04T05:23:52Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-03T23:23:52-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-03T23:23:58-06:00\nCommand exited with code 0.\n\nCommand output:\n=== 1. ESCANEO PNP USB (TODOS LOS DISPOSITIVOS USB CONECTADOS A LA PC) ===\n\r\nName   Status DeviceID                             \r\n----   ------ --------                             \r\nXview+ OK     USB\\VID_18D1&PID_4EE1\\Z41220090388172\r\n\r\n\r\n=== 2. ADB DEVICES ===\nList of devices attached\r\n\r\n=== 3. FASTBOOT MODERNO DEVICES ===\n=== 4. ADNL DEVICES ===\n=== 5. UPDATE.EXE IDENTIFY ===\n[update]:No [WorldCup Device] device after scan\r\n[update]ERR(L1094):can not find device\r\n=== 6. UNIDADES USB EN LA PC ===\n\r\n\r\nDriveLetter     : C\r\nFileSystemLabel : Windows SSD\r\nFileSystem      : NTFS\r\nDriveType       : Fixed\r\nSizeRemaining   : 62963384320\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"}
{"step_index":226,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-04T05:23:59Z","input_tokens":4966,"cache_read_tokens":75861,"output_tokens":11145,"thinking":"The system identified the device correctly based on the output. The radar script in the specified file seems to have successfully recognized the box based on the provided serial number. This confirms the initial detection and allows further examination of the device's state.\n\n\nThe device is correctly communicating via USB in MTP mode. The device's Android debug options likely have USB debugging disabled, preventing ADB mode. Checking if a batch script and PowerShell script show the serial number.\n\n\nThe script `Get-BoxConnectionState` in `MOTOR_PROGRAMA_PERFECTO.ps1` should be updated to extract the exact serial number from the device ID when in MTP mode. Adding an \"Auto-Catch\" option that monitors for USB debugging activation would allow the program to automatically trigger the liberation process when the device switches to the expected state, currently connected via USB in `PID_4EE1`. This aims to streamline the user experience by automating the transition from MTP to ADB mode.\n\n\nChecking for two scenarios. First, if the user can enable USB debugging directly via settings, the USB ID should transition to ADB mode. Second, if the device is inaccessible, investigating if a reset or USB drive interaction can trigger debug options.\n\n\nThe device entering the Android Recovery Menu after connecting via USB suggests a specific hardware interaction. Selecting \"Enter fastboot\" in the recovery menu changes the USB ID to `fastbootd`, which the existing scripts can handle. The script should be modified to show the correct serial number and include an \"Auto-Radar\" feature that monitors for the activation of USB debugging, automatically initiating the liberation process upon detection.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"# ==============================================================================\n# MOTOR PRINCIPAL: PROGRAMA PERFECTO XVIEW+ (ZTE ZXV10 B866V2 - S905X2 G12A)\n# Fusion integral de todas las herramientas de la memoria USB + hallazgos REA\n# Regla absoluta: 100% Externo (Cero tornillos, Cero TTL, Proteccion Widevine L1)\n# ==============================================================================\n\n[Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8\n$ErrorActionPreference = \"Continue\"\n\n$ROOT_DIR   = Split-Path -Parent $PSScriptRoot\n$MOTOR_DIR  = Join-Path $ROOT_DIR \"1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR\"\n$APKS_DIR   = Join-Path $ROOT_DIR \"2_APKS_LIBERACION_Y_TV\"\n$KEYS_DIR   = Join-Path $ROOT_DIR \"3_LLAVES_USB_PARA_LA_CAJA\"\n$DRV_DIR    = Join-Path $ROOT_DIR \"4_DRIVERS_Y_GUI_WINDOWS\"\n$FW_DIR     = Join-Path $ROOT_DIR \"5_FIRMWARE_SEGURO_B866V2\"\n\n$ADB        = Join-Path $MOTOR_DIR \"adb.exe\"\n$FASTBOOT   = Join-Path $MOTOR_DIR \"fastboot_moderno.exe\"\nif (-not (Test-Path $FASTBOOT)) { $FASTBOOT = Join-Path $MOTOR_DIR \"fastboot.exe\" }\n$ADNL       = Join-Path $MOTOR_DIR \"adnl.exe\"\n$UPDATE     = Join-Path $MOTOR_DIR \"update.exe\"\n\n$Global:ADB_TARGET_ARGS = @()\n$Global:CONNECTED_IP    = \"\"\n\nfunction Invoke-Adb {\n    param([string[]]$Arguments)\n    $allArgs = @()\n    if ($Global:ADB_TARGET_ARGS.Count -gt 0) { $allArgs += $Global:ADB_TARGET_ARGS }\n    $allArgs += $Arguments\n    & $ADB @allArgs\n}\n\nfunction Get-BoxConnectionState {\n    $state = [ordered]@{\n        UsbHardwareMode = \"Ninguno detectado por cable USB directo\"\n        SerialNumber    = \"No detectado\"\n        RawPid          = \"\"\n        AdbDevices      = @()\n        FastbootDevices = @()\n    }\n\n    # 1. Escanear PnP USB (VID_18D1 Google/Android, VID_19D2 ZTE, VID_1B8E Amlogic WorldCup)\n    try {\n        $pnp = Get-CimInstance Win32_PnPEntity -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object {\n            $_.DeviceID -match \"VID_18D1|VID_19D2|VID_1B8E\"\n        }\n        foreach ($dev in $pnp) {\n            if ($dev.DeviceID -match \"\\\\([^\\\\]+)$\") {\n                $sn = $Matches[1]\n                if ($sn -notmatch \"&\") { $state.SerialNumber = $sn }\n            }\n            if ($dev.DeviceID -match \"PID_4EE2\") {\n                $state.UsbHardwareMode = \"ADB USB Activo (PID_4EE2) - LISTO PARA LIBERAR\"\n                $state.RawPid = \"4EE2\"\n            }\n            elseif ($dev.DeviceID -match \"PID_4EE7\") {\n                $state.UsbHardwareMode = \"Recovery Fastbootd (PID_4EE7) - LISTO PARA PUENTE FASTBOOT\"\n                $state.RawPid = \"4EE7\"\n            }\n            elseif ($dev.DeviceID -match \"PID_0D02\") {\n                $state.UsbHardwareMode = \"U-Boot Fastboot Bootloader (PID_0D02) - LISTO PARA FLASHEO\"\n                $state.RawPid = \"0D02\"\n            }\n            elseif ($dev.DeviceID -match \"PID_4EE1\") {\n                $state.UsbHardwareMode = \"Modo MTP Android Normal (PID_4EE1 - Falta activar Depuracion USB en TV)\"\n                $state.RawPid = \"4EE1\"\n            }\n            elseif ($dev.DeviceID -match \"VID_1B8E\") {\n                $state.UsbHardwareMode = \"Amlogic WorldCup / DNL Burn Mode (VID_1B8E)\"\n                $state.RawPid = \"1B8E\"\n            }\n        }\n    } catch {}\n\n    # 2. Escanear ADB\n    if (Test-Path $ADB) {\n        $adbOut = & $ADB devices 2>$null\n        foreach ($line in $adbOut) {\n            if ($line -match \"^(\\S+)\\s+(device|unauthorized|offline)$\") {\n                $state.AdbDevices += \"$($Matches[1]) [$($Matches[2])]\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    # 3. Escanear Fastboot\n    if (Test-Path $FASTBOOT) {\n        $fbOut = & $FASTBOOT devices 2>$null\n        foreach ($line in $fbOut) {\n            if ($line -match \"^(\\S+)\\s+fastboot\") {\n                $state.FastbootDevices += $Matches[1]\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    return $state\n}\n\nfunction Show-Banner {\n    Clear-Host\n    Write-Host \"================================================================================\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"          PROGRAMA PERFECTO - MEGACABLE XVIEW+ (ZTE ZXV10 B866V2)               \" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"     Fusion Total USB + ADB + Fastboot + ADNL + Launchers + Desbloqueo ZTE      \" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"      Regla: 100% Externo Sin Abrir Tornillos | Proteccion Widevine L1/MAC      \" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n    Write-Host \"================================================================================\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n\n    $st = Get-BoxConnectionState\n    Write-Host \"\"\n    Write-Host \" [RADAR DE CONEXION EN TIEMPO REAL]\" -ForegroundColor Yellow\n    Write-Host \"  * Caja Detectada   : Xview+ (Serie: $($st.SerialNumber))\" -ForegroundColor White\n    if ($st.RawPid -eq \"4EE2\" -or $st.RawPid -eq \"0D02\" -or $st.RawPid -eq \"4EE7\") {\n        Write-Host \"  * Estado Cable USB : $($st.UsbHardwareMode)\" -ForegroundColor Green\n    } elseif ($st.RawPid -eq \"4EE1\") {\n        Write-Host \"  * Estado Cable USB : $($st.UsbHardwareMode)\" -ForegroundColor Yellow\n    } else {\n        Write-Host \"  * Estado Cable USB : $($st.UsbHardwareMode)\" -ForegroundColor Gray\n    }\n    if ($st.AdbDevices.Count -gt 0) {\n        Write-Host \"  * Sesion ADB       : $($st.AdbDevices -join ', ')\" -ForegroundColor Green\n    } else {\n        Write-Host \"  * Sesion ADB       : En espera de Depuracion USB (PID_4EE2) o IP de Red Local\" -ForegroundColor DarkGray\n    }\n    if ($st.FastbootDevices.Count -gt 0) {\n        Write-Host \"  * Sesion Fastboot  : $($st.FastbootDevices -join ', ')\" -ForegroundColor Green\n    } else {\n        Write-Host \"  * Sesion Fastboot  : Ninguna activa\" -ForegroundColor DarkGray\n    }\n    Write-Host \"--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\" -ForegroundColor DarkCyan\n}\n\nfunction Connect-AdbTarget {\n    Write-Host \"\"\n    Write-Host \"=== CONECTAR CAJA POR RED LOCAL (WI-FI / ETHERNET) O CABLE USB ===\" -ForegroundColor Yellow\n    Write-Host \"NOTA: Si usas router/modem, desconecta el cable de Internet del modem para evitar\" -ForegroundColor Gray\n    Write-Host \"      que aparezca la pantalla azul de Megacable mientras activas Depuracion USB.\" -ForegroundColor Gray\n    W